@ cases.a-module-function-of-a-prelude-file-needs-the-module-in-the-list
description = "A file without the prelude sees std::prelude::Collections only through its import: U64::of_text, a function the file adds to the core's U64, is listed by the module U64."
files_tote = "app"
tote_errors = ["`U64::of_text` comes through `import std::prelude::collections`, whose list does not write it; write `U64` in its list"]
files."app/Tauto.eure" = ```eure
package {
  name = "app"
  prelude = false
}
```
files."app/src/main.taut" = ```tauto
import std::prelude::collections { Bytes }
import std::prelude::std { Option }

pub fn same(b: Bytes): Bytes { b }
pub fn digits(): Option(u64) { U64::of_text("12") }
```

